-- ============================================================
-- SINGLE INSTANCE
-- Re-executing the script stops the previous copy (its loops exit and it can
-- no longer send anything), and alert memory survives the re-execute, so
-- eggs that were already alerted are NOT alerted again.
-- ============================================================

